      "representative_excerpt": "I appreciate the opportunity to comment on EPA\u2019s proposed partial approval and partial disapproval of Hawaii\u2019s second implementation-period regional haze SIP. I visited Hawaii in 1999 and remember how extraordinary the landscapes and visibility could be. I also understand that Hawaii faces unusual conditions, including severe fire risk from high winds and po...",
